<h2 id="syncing-production-with-neon-twin" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Syncing Production with Neon Twin</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#syncing-production-with-neon-twin" aria-label="Link to Syncing Production with Neon Twin"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>The final piece of this puzzle is to re-synchronize your production database with your Neon Twin. In a <a href="https://neon.tech/blog/optimizing-dev-environments-in-aws-rds-with-neon-postgres-part-ii-using-github-actions-to-mirror-rds-in-neon">previous post</a> we explained how to perform a dump/restore using a scheduled GitHub Action, for this workflow we’ll use a similar approach but rather than the dump/restore running on a schedule, it’ll run after production migrations have been applied.</p>
<p>For either of the above Actions you could add the following which will perform a fresh dump/restore from your production database back to your Neon Twin.</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full" data-has-filename="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables has-diff" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="yaml"><code class="grid"><span class="line diff add" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">name</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> Migrate to prod (...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;on:&lt;br&gt;  pull_request:&lt;br&gt;    types</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> [</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">closed</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">]</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">&lt;br&gt;    branches:&lt;br&gt;      - main&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;env:&lt;br&gt;  PROD_DATABASE_URL</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> ${{ secrets.PROD_DATABASE_URL }}</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"> # Production or primary database&lt;br&gt;  DEV_DATABASE_URL: ${{ secrets.DEV_DATABASE_URL }} # Development database&lt;br&gt;  PG_VERSION: &#x27;16&#x27;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;jobs:&lt;br&gt;  pr-merged:&lt;br&gt;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&lt;br&gt;    if: github.event.pull_request.merged == true # Ensure the PR was merged&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    steps:       ...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; dump-and-restore: # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;  runs-on: ubuntu-latest # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  steps: # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;    - name: Install PostgreSQL # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;      run: | # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;        sudo apt update # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;        yes &#x27;&#x27; | sudo /usr/share/postgresql-common/pgdg/apt.postgresql.org.sh # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;        sudo apt install -y postgresql-${{ env.PG_VERSION }} # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    - name: Dump from RDS and Restore to Neon # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;      run: | # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;        /usr/lib/postgresql/${{ env.PG_VERSION }}/bin/pg_dump &quot;${{ env.PROD_DATABASE_URL }}&quot; -Fc -f &quot;${{ github.workspace }}/prod-dump-file.dump&quot; # [!code ++]&lt;br&gt;        /usr/lib/postgresql/${{ env.PG_VERSION }}/bin/pg_restore -d &quot;${{ env.DEV_DATABASE_URL }}&quot; --clean --no-owner --no-acl --if-exists &quot;${{ github.workspace }}/prod-dump-file.dump&quot; # [!code ++]</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
